AB  - We present a customized Artificial Intelligence (AI) chatbot tailored for educational environments. Unlike conventional models that rely solely on pretrained knowledge, our system integrates rule-based keyword matching and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) with internal educational resources to produce accurate, contextually relevant responses aligned with specific lesson plans. The chatbot adapts answers based on user attributes such as age group, predefined lesson schemas, and institution-defined content. To improve precision, it actively engages users by requesting clarification when needed. We deploy a compact large language model, Qwen-14B, optimized to run efficiently on a local setup with 16GB VRAM. This requires a sophisticated workflow to sustain performance and responsiveness. For general queries beyond the internal database, the chatbot seamlessly switches to a general-purpose mode, balancing flexibility with educational alignment.
