AB  - The given work is an introduction to MediBot, which is an AI-driven healthcare chatbot designed using the Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) model of providing relevant and contextual medical information. By combining large language model generation with semantic document retrieval, the system bases responses on medical literature that is proven to be valid thus minimizing hallucinations and enhancing factual accuracy. Medical records are domain specific documents that are embedded and indexed to enable easy retrieval and the context of the retrieved is integrated with user queries to give informed responses. MediBot is implemented as a framework of real-time interactive application, which indicates the practical relevance of retrieval-enhanced large language models in virtual medical consultation and delivery of health information. The given strategy identifies the promise of the RAG-based systems to deliver scalable, reliable, and trustful AI-assisted healthcare support.
