AB  - Enterprise chatbots which put up with issues of data privacy, response accuracy, and scalability are common. We present a privacy protected enterprise chatbot which puts together retrieval augmented generation with local large language models to enable secure and efficient natural language interaction. Our system which puts together document retrieval, contextual embedding, and local inference is put forth as a solution to data leakage which at the same time sees to it that response quality is improved. We report that we have seen improved accuracy and reduced response latency when compared to traditional chatbot approaches. Also, we report that the results of our study which looked at local RAG based architectures do in fact point to their great promise for secure enterprise scale conversational systems.
