AB  - An AI-driven platform making use of RetrievalAugmented Generation (RAG) to create scalable, sensitive to context educational content. The platform combines a document retrieval module with a large language model (LLM) to generate flashcards, sample exam questions, responses to frequently asked questions (FAQs), and interactive chat support. This approach addresses common drawbacks of LLMs most notably outdated knowledge and fabricated content by grounding generation in relevant source materials. Related work on AI in education and question generation is reviewed, followed by a description of the platform architecture and RAG framework, along with details of the content-generation modules. Experiments evaluating content quality and usability are then presented, with discussion of findings and potential directions for future development.
